        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF147 supports brotli compression in <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CompressionStream/CompressionStream\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">CompressionStream</code> constructor</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/DecompressionStream/DecompressionStream\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">DecompressionStream()</code> constructor</a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1921583\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1921583</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note. It also updates the two constructors to include the brotli option and zstd option (which is also supported).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3699242115\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42251\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42251/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42251\">#42251</a></p>",
