            "author": {
                "name": "abhinav12222363",
                "url": "https://github.com/abhinav12222363"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26078826?u=9388a2c2a0f1ca2799a4fd23f3e060c353d6ac37&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated the explanation regarding the use of parameters in the JavaScript MIME type for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;script type=...&gt;</code></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Current wording is outdated, because <code class=\"notranslate\">module</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">importmap</code> now exist.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/script/type#value\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/script/type#value</a></p>",
