        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF147 adds support for module scripts in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1986681\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1986681</a>. This allows you to do stuff like below to import a stylesheet and adopt it into your document.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"import sheet from './styles.css' with { type: 'css' };\ndocument.adoptedStyleSheets = [sheet];\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">import</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">sheet</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">from</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">'./styles.css'</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">with</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">type</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">'css'</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">adoptedStyleSheets</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">sheet</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3699248949\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42255\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42255/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42255\">#42255</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42306",
            "title": "FF147 Relnote: CSS Module scripts",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-09T02:36:08.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-09T00:59:23.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF147 implements module service workers in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1360870\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1360870</a>. This adds the release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can bet tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3699239325\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42249\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42249/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42249\">#42249</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42304",
